1. c4 e6 2. Nc3 d5 3. d4 Nf6 4. cxd5 Nxd5 5. e4 Nxc3 6. bxc3 c5 7. Nf3 cxd4 8. cxd4 Bb4+ 9. Bd2 Bxd2+ 10. Qxd2 O-O 11. Bc4 Nd7 12. O-O b6 13. a4 Bb7 14. Bd3 (14. Rfe1 Nf6 15. Bd3 h6 16. a5 a6 17. axb6 Qxb6 18. Rab1 Qc7 19. Rbc1 Qe7 20. Qa5 Rfc8 21. Rxc8+ Rxc8 22. Nd2 Qd7 23. Qb6 Rc3 24. Bxa6 Bxa6 25. Qxa6 Qxd4 $15 {1/2-1/2 (97) Topalov,V (2803)-Carlsen,M (2850) London 2015}) 14... Rb8 (14... a5 15. Rfc1 e5 16. d5 $14 {0-1 (57) Kramnik,V (2783)-Naiditsch,A (2722) Dortmund 2015}) (14... Rc8 15. a5 Qc7 16. Rfb1 h6 17. h3 Rfd8 18. Ra3 Qd6 19. Rab3 Rc7 20. axb6 Nxb6 $14 {1/2-1/2 (34) Ding,L (2707) -Kramnik,V (2801) Paris/ St Petersburg 2013}) 15. Rfe1 h6 16. a5 b5 17. Rac1 (17. a6!?) 17... a6 18. Qb4 Rc8 19. Nd2 Rxc1 20. Rxc1 {[#]} Ne5? {Too optimistic.} (20... Qb8 {with the idea} 21. Rc8 $11) 21. Bxb5 axb5 22. dxe5 Qd3 23. h3 Rd8 24. Rc7 Ba8 (24... Qxd2 25. Qxd2 Rxd2 26. Rxb7 Ra2 27. Rxb5 $18) 25. Qe7 Rf8 26. Qd6 Qe2 (26... Rd8 27. Qxd3 Rxd3 28. Rc8+ Kh7 29. Rxa8 Rxd2 30. Rb8 $18) 27. f3 Qe3+ 28. Kh2 Qf4+ 29. Kh1 b4 30. a6 h5 31. a7 h4 32. Qxb4 Qxe5 33. Qc5 Qxc5 34. Rxc5 Rd8 35. Nc4 Kh7 ({After} 35... Kh7 36. Nb6 Kg6 37. Rc7 {Black has hardly any moves - therefore he resigned.}) 1-0

