{[%evp 0,51,13,31,35,-7,38,24,32,42,44,-33,32,9,28,17,29,9,9,9,12,-4,46,26,14,14,28,36,13,-13,-5,15,15,31,49,49,-35,-57,38,32,17,45,48,22,29,118,115,12,122,110,110,121,378,411]} 1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. e3 Nf6 4. Nc3 e6 5. b3 b6 6. Bb2 Bb7 7. Bd3 Nbd7 8. Nge2!? (8. Nf3 {is the usual move.}) 8... Bd6 9. O-O O-O 10. Ng3 c5 11. cxd5 {White's idea putting his knight on g3 becomes obvious: he wants to go to f5!} cxd4 (11... Nxd5 12. Nxd5 Bxd5 13. dxc5 Nxc5 14. Qg4! {looked dangerous for Black too:} g6 (14... f6 15. Bc2 $14) 15. Bc4 Bxc4 16. Qxc4 $14) 12. Nce4 Bxg3 (12... Nxe4 13. Nxe4 $14) 13. Nxg3! {An excellent pawn sacrifice.} (13. fxg3 Nxd5 14. Nd6 Qc7! (14... Nxe3? 15. Bxh7+! Kxh7 16. Qxd4 $16) 15. Nxb7 Qxb7 16. exd4 N7f6 {would be unclear: the pawn structure compensates for the two bishops.}) 13... dxe3 (13... Nxd5 14. Bxd4 $14 {is not what Black wants.}) 14. dxe6 exf2+ 15. Rxf2 fxe6 16. Qe2 {Black has an extra pawn, but look how beautifully the white pieces are coordinated!} Nc5 17. Bc2 Ba6 18. Qe1 Qe8?! {An imprecise move, in a position where Black was already on the verge of being lost.} (18... Nd5! {was required, and White would only be slighly better:} 19. Rxf8+ (19. Rd1 Rxf2 20. Qxf2 Qg5 $132) (19. b4 Rxf2 20. Kxf2 Nxb4!! 21. Qxb4 Qd3!! $13 {Wow!}) 19... Qxf8 20. b4 Nd3 21. Qxe6+ Qf7 22. Qxf7+ Kxf7 23. Rf1+ Ke6 {and Black has good chances to hold.}) 19. Rd1! Rc8 (19... Rd8!? 20. Rxd8 Qxd8 21. b4 Nd3! 22. Qxe6+ Kh8 23. Rd2 Qc8! 24. Qxc8 Rxc8 25. Bxf6 gxf6 26. Nh5! {and Black is still in trouble.} (26. Bxd3? Rd8 $132)) 20. b4 Nb7 {Oh, no! Putting the knight there is definitely a bad sign.} 21. Ne4 {White's superiority is just overwhelming now.} (21. a4!?) 21... Nd5 (21... Nh5 22. Rxf8+ Qxf8 23. Bb1 Qe7 24. Ng5! $18) (21... Qe7 22. Nxf6+ gxf6 23. Qe4 e5 24. b5 Bxb5 25. Qd5+ $18) 22. Rxf8+ Qxf8 23. Bb1 (23. Bb3!? {followed by g5 was also completely winning.}) 23... Qxb4 24. Nf6+! Kh8 (24... gxf6 25. Qxe6+ $18) 25. Qxe6 Ra8?! (25... Ne7 26. Qh3 h6 27. Ba1 $18) 26. Qxd5 {This game was a work of art! There's little one can do when Magnus turns on to Beast mode.} 1-0

