1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 e6 3. d4 cxd4 4. Nxd4 Nc6 5. Nc3 Qc7 6. a3 a6 7. Be3 Be7 8. f4 b5 9. Nxc6 Qxc6 10. Bd3 Bb7 11. O-O Nf6 12. Kh1 d5 13. exd5 Nxd5 14. Be4 Qd7 15. Bxd5 Bxd5 16. Nxd5 Qxd5 17. Qxd5 exd5 18. Bd4 f6 19. g3 Kf7 20. Kg2 Rhe8 21. Kf3 Rac8 22. Rf2 Bc5 23. Rd1 Re4 24. Bxc5 Rxc5 25. Rd3 {[#] Objectively the rook ending is equal but that can be said of many endgames Carlsen has won.} b4? ({Better is} 25... a5 {After} 26. Rxd5 {Black has} Rxf4+) 26. Rxd5 Rxd5 ({Now} 26... Rxf4+ 27. gxf4 Rxd5 28. axb4 {costs a pawn.}) 27. Kxe4 Rb5 28. a4 Ra5 29. b3 Rc5 30. c4 bxc3 31. Rc2 Ke6 32. Kd4 Rd5+ 33. Kxc3 Kf5 34. Kc4 Rd8 35. b4 Kg4 36. b5 axb5+ 37. axb5 h5 38. b6 Rc8+ 39. Kd3 Rb8 40. Rb2 h4 41. gxh4 Kxf4 42. b7 Ke5 43. h5 f5 1-0

