{[%evp 0,67,21,22,33,-9,0,-4,13,13,33,-2,8,-20,-25,-24,-3,-71,-46,-51,2,-2,4,10,46,14,19,-7,-10,12,13,-16,-7,-7,-16,-27,-19,-67,1,-56,-18,-22,-22,-41,-50,-37,9,-28,-26,0,29,21,51,34,56,26,26,57,61,43,43,33,75,88,93,121,302,303,306,321]} 1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 d5 4. Nc3 Bb4 5. cxd5 exd5 6. Bf4 Nc6 7. Rc1 Ne4 8. Nd2 g5 9. Be3 Nxc3 10. bxc3 Ba3 {The latest fashion.} (10... Bd6 {has been played in several other games:} 11. h4 Bf4 12. Bxf4 gxf4 13. e3 fxe3 14. Qe2 O-O (14... Qe7 15. Qxe3 Qxe3+ 16. fxe3 Ne7 17. Bd3 Bf5 18. e4 dxe4 19. Nxe4 O-O-O 20. O-O Rhg8 21. Rf3 $14 {½-½ (54) Erenberg,A (2442)-Gavrilescu,D (2473) Pardubice 2019}) 15. fxe3 Ne7 16. Qf3 Nf5 17. e4 dxe4 18. Nxe4 Qe7 19. Bd3 Nd6 20. O-O $16 {1-0 (45) Xiong,J (2691)-Burke,J (2562) Philadelphia 2019.}) 11. Rb1 f5 12. g3 (12. f4!? {is worth a look too:} Qe7 13. Bf2 gxf4 14. g3! fxg3 (14... b6!? {might be a good try:} 15. c4!? Bd7!? 16. cxd5 fxg3 17. hxg3 Na5 $13) 15. hxg3 O-O 16. Bg2 Be6 17. Rxb7 Rab8 18. Rxb8 Rxb8 19. Qa4 Rb6 20. O-O Bb2 21. Nc4! dxc4 22. d5 Bf7 23. Bxb6 axb6 24. Qxc6 Bxc3 25. Qxc4 Qe3+ 26. Kh2 $18 {1-0 (50) Nyzhnyk,I (2665)-Grischuk,A (2777) chess.com 2020}) 12... O-O (12... Bd6 {is considered critical here as well:} 13. Rg1!? O-O 14. h4 f4 15. gxf4 g4 16. Rb5 (16. c4!?) 16... Ne7 17. f5 (17. Nf3!?) 17... h5 18. Bg5 c6 19. Rb2 Rxf5 20. e4 Rxg5 21. hxg5 Ng6 22. e5 Bf8 23. Bd3 Nf4 24. Nf1 Qxg5 25. f3?? Nxd3+ 26. Qxd3 Qc1+ $19 {0-1 (33) Carlsen,M (2863)-Giri,A (2764) chess24.com 2020}) 13. Qb3 Be7 14. f4 Na5 15. Qc2 c6 16. Bg2 (16. fxg5 Bxg5 $132) 16... Bd6 17. c4!? {White needs to react in the centre.} gxf4 {A very risky move.} (17... Qe7!? 18. Bf2 Be6!? 19. c5 (19. cxd5 Bxd5 20. Bxd5+ cxd5 21. fxg5 Rac8 $36) 19... Bc7 20. e3 Rab8 $11) 18. gxf4 (18. Bxf4!? {could have led to very wild positions:} Bxf4 19. gxf4 Qh4+ 20. Kd1 Qf2! (20... Qxf4 21. Qc3 Nxc4 22. Nxc4 dxc4 23. Rg1! $40) 21. Qc3! (21. Bf3 Qxd4 22. cxd5 Rd8 $13) 21... Nxc4 (21... Qxg2 22. Kc2 $40) 22. Nxc4 Qxg2 23. Kd2 Qe4 24. Rhg1+ Kh8 25. Rbf1! Qe7 (25... dxc4?? 26. d5+ $18) 26. Ne5 $14) 18... Be6 19. cxd5 cxd5 20. O-O Kh8 21. Nf3 Nc4 22. Qd3 b6 23. Kh1 Qe7?! {A loss of time.} (23... Rg8 24. Ne5 Bxe5 25. fxe5 Nxe3 26. Qxe3 Qh4 $132) 24. Ne5 Bxe5?! 25. fxe5 Rg8 (25... Nxe3 26. Qxe3 Qh4 27. Qf4 $14) 26. Bf4 Rg6 27. Bh3 Rf8 28. Rf3 Qh4 29. Rbf1 {Now Carlsen has got all he wanted!} Qh5 30. Bc1 Rfg8? {Giving away a pawn... for free!} (30... Rf7 $142) 31. Bxf5 Rg2 32. Bh3! Rxe2 (32... Bxh3 33. Rxh3 $18) 33. Qxe2 Bxh3 34. Rg1 1-0

