1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. Nc3 e6 5. e3 Nbd7 6. Bd3 dxc4 7. Bxc4 b5 8. Bd3 Bd6 9. Nd2!? {This had been played only once before.} Bb7 10. Nce4 $146 (10. O-O {Volkov,S (2633)-Romanov,E (2547)/Dagomys 2008/CBM 124 (0-1, 46)}) 10... Be7 11. Nxf6+ Nxf6 12. O-O O-O 13. Nb3 {White seems to have established some control over the c5-square, but is underdeveloped, justifying Black's next move.} c5! 14. dxc5 Qd5 15. f3 Rfd8 16. Be2 Qe5 17. Qe1 Bd5 18. Qc3 Qxc3 19. bxc3 Bxb3 20. axb3 Nd5 21. b4 Nxc3 22. Kf2 a5 {Black has retrieved the pawn and even has some initiative.} 23. Rxa5 Rxa5 24. bxa5 Bxc5 25. Bb2 Nxe2 26. Kxe2 Bb4 27. Ra1! {An elegant way to stay out of troubles.} Rd2+ 28. Kf1 Rxb2 29. a6 Bc5 30. Rc1 g6 31. Rxc5 Ra2 32. Rxb5 Rxa6 1/2-1/2

