{[%evp 0,76,22,-2,-2,-37,11,-4,37,42,33,33,47,40,40,-25,-7,5,39,36,27,-1,25,6,42,45,87,58,67,50,54,65,32,29,29,29,34,18,33,21,21,9,1,12,0,0,0,0,0,38,38,20,29,26,44,51,42,45,54,108,127,123,105,111,177,179,194,135,123,116,136,103,110,149,149,149,238,239,237]} 1. c4 e5 2. g3 c6 3. d4 Bb4+ {Not the main move here.Especially popular is second one} (3... exd4 4. Qxd4 d5 5. Nf3 Nf6 6. Bg2 dxc4 (6... Be7 $142) 7. Qxd8+ Kxd8 8. O-O Nbd7 9. Rd1 Ke8 10. Nbd2 Nb6 11. Ne5 Be6 12. Nxc6 Bd5 13. Na5 Bxg2 14. Kxg2 Rc8 15. Nf3 Nbd5 16. Nxb7 Rc7 17. Na5 Bb4 18. e4 Nb6 19. Bf4 Rc8 20. Nb7 Nxe4 21. a3 Be7 22. Re1 g5 23. Nd4 {1-0 (23) Suba,M (2500)-Sax,G (2550) Baile Herculane 1982}) (3... e4 4. Nc3 Bb4 5. Qb3 a5 6. Bf4 d5 7. e3 Nf6 8. a3 Bxc3+ 9. Qxc3 O-O 10. Ne2 h6 11. c5 Bg4 12. h3 Bf3 13. Rg1 Nh7 14. g4 Ng5 15. Ng3 Ne6 16. Bd6 Re8 17. Nf5 Nd7 18. h4 Kh7 19. Bh2 b6 20. cxb6 Qxb6 21. g5 hxg5 22. hxg5 c5 23. dxc5 Ndxc5 24. Nd6 d4 25. exd4 Nxd4 26. Bc4 Nd3+ 27. Kf1 Ne2 {0-1 (27) Naiditsch,A (2734)-Anton Guijarro,D (2642) Caleta 2019}) 4. Bd2 Bxd2+ 5. Qxd2 d6 6. Nc3 Nf6 7. e4 (7. Bg2 O-O 8. e3 Be6 9. Rd1 Qa5 10. d5 cxd5 11. Nxd5 Qxd2+ 12. Rxd2 Nxd5 13. Bxd5 Bxd5 14. Rxd5 Rd8 15. Ne2 Nd7 16. Rxd6 Nc5 17. Rxd8+ Rxd8 18. Nc3 Nd3+ 19. Ke2 Nxb2 20. Rb1 Nxc4 21. Rxb7 f5 22. Rc7 Nb6 23. e4 f4 24. gxf4 exf4 25. Kf3 g5 26. Kg4 Rd2 27. e5 Rxf2 28. Ne4 Re2 29. Nf6+ Kf8 30. Kf5 {1-0 (30) Delchev,A (2620)-Huzman,A (2607) Rogaska Slatina 2011}) 7... O-O 8. Nge2 {A bit unusual move order,as more natural seems to be} (8. Bg2 Be6 9. b3 Qa5 10. Nge2 b5 11. d5 Bc8 12. cxb5 cxb5 13. a3 Qb6 14. O-O a5 15. Rfb1 Na6 16. b4 Bd7 17. Nd1 Nc7 18. Nc1 a4 19. h3 Nfe8 20. Ne3 g6 21. Ne2 Ng7 22. Kh2 Rae8 23. Re1 Re7 24. Rac1 Nce8 25. Rc3 f5 26. exf5 gxf5 27. f4 Nf6 28. Rf1 Rfe8 29. fxe5 Rxe5 30. Nd4 Ne4 31. Bxe4 Rxe4 32. Rd3 Qd8 33. Ng2 Qf6 34. Nf4 Rc8 35. Rf2 Rc4 36. Nfe2 h6 37. Ne6 Qa1 38. Nxg7 Kxg7 39. Re3 Qe5 40. Rxe4 Rxe4 41. Nf4 Qa1 42. Qd3 Re1 43. Qf3 Qd1 44. Ne2 Qb3 45. Nc3 Qxa3 46. g4 Qc1 47. Ne2 Qa1 48. gxf5 Qe5+ 49. Ng3 Re3 50. Qg4+ Kf8 51. Qg6 Be8 52. Qxh6+ Ke7 53. f6+ Kd8 54. Qg7 a3 55. Qg8 a2 56. Rxa2 Qxf6 57. Ra8+ Kc7 58. Qh7+ Bd7 59. Qc2+ Rc3 60. Qa2 Bc8 61. Qa5+ Kd7 62. Qxb5+ Ke7 63. Ra2 Qh4 64. Re2+ Kd8 65. Qe8+ Kc7 66. Re7+ {1-0 (66) Balog,I (2550)-Balogh,C (2591) Hungary HUN 2019}) 8... b5 9. cxb5 cxb5 10. a3 a5 (10... Nc6 11. Bg2 Na5 12. dxe5 Nc4 13. Qc2 dxe5 14. Nxb5 Qa5+ 15. Nbc3 Rb8 16. Ra2 Be6 17. O-O Rfc8) 11. Bg2 Bb7 12. O-O b4 (12... Qb6 13. Nd5 Nxd5 14. exd5 Nd7 15. dxe5 Nxe5 16. Nd4) 13. axb4 axb4 14. Nd5 Nxd5 15. exd5 Qb6 (15... Na6 16. Rfd1 Nc7 17. dxe5 dxe5 18. d6) 16. Rxa8 Bxa8 17. dxe5 dxe5 {[#]} 18. g4! Nd7 19. Ng3 g6 20. Rc1 ({Its always a question where to place Rook -on open file ,or to support central passed pawn.} 20. Rd1) 20... Rd8 21. Ne4 Nf6 (21... Kg7) 22. Nxf6+ Qxf6 23. Rc5 Qb6 (23... Qd6 24. Qxb4?! (24. Ra5) 24... e4! 25. Bxe4 Qf4) 24. Qe3 Qa7 25. Qc1! {Continuing his strategy to penetrate c file.} Bb7 26. h4! {Classical-always useful to try to create another weakness.} Qb6 (26... h6 27. h5 g5 28. Rb5) 27. h5 h6 28. Qe3 (28. hxg6 Qxg6 29. Rb5 Ba6 30. Rxb4 Be2 31. Qc7) 28... gxh5? (28... Rd6) 29. Rc8 Qd6 30. Rxd8+ Qxd8 31. Qxh6 Bxd5 (31... hxg4 32. Be4! Bxd5 33. Qh7+ Kf8 34. Qh8+) 32. Qd2! {simple refutation.} hxg4 33. Qxd5 Qxd5 34. Bxd5 Kg7 35. Kg2 f5 36. Kg3 Kf6 37. Kh4 e4 38. Bc6 Ke5 39. Kg3 Kd4 40. Kf4 Kd3 41. Kxf5 e3 42. fxe3 Kxe3 43. b3! {It is necessary tio be careful till to the end!} (43. Kxg4?? b3 44. Bd5 Kd2 45. Bxb3 Kc1) 1-0

