1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nf3 Bg7 4. g3 O-O 5. Bg2 c5 6. Nc3 cxd4 7. Nxd4 Qc7 (7... Nc6 8. O-O {leads to the classic A39 system.}) 8. Ncb5 {White usually plays} (8. b3) (8. Nd5) ({or} 8. Qd3) (8. Ndb5!? {looks more logical than the text move, e.g.} Qxc4 9. b3 Qc5 10. Be3 Qb4 11. a3 Qa5 12. b4 Qd8 13. Nxa7 Ng4 14. Bd4 Bxd4 15. Qxd4 Nc6 16. Qxg4 Rxa7 17. Qf4 e5 18. Qc4 $14 {0-1 Tregubov,P (2607)-Kurnosov,I (2549)/Kazan 2005/CBM 109 (34)}) 8... Qxc4 9. b3 (9. Bd2 Nc6 10. Rc1 Qxa2 11. Ra1 Qc4 12. Rc1 Qa2 13. Ra1 Qc4 {1/2 Edzgveradze,N (2295)-Kovchan,A (2369)/Alushta 1999/EXT 2000}) 9... Qc5 10. Ba3 Qb6 11. Bxe7 Re8 12. Nd6?! {Too aggressive.} (12. Ba3? a6 13. Nd6 Qa5+) (12. Rc1 Rxe7 13. Rxc8+ Re8 14. Rxe8+ Nxe8 15. e3 Nc6 $11) (12. Bd6 a6 13. Bc7 Qc5 14. Bd6 Qb6 $11) 12... Rxe7 13. Nxc8 Qb4+ 14. Kf1 (14. Qd2 Qxd2+ 15. Kxd2 Ne4+ 16. Ke1 Re8 17. Rd1 Na6! 18. Bxe4 Rxe4 19. Nb5 Rxc8 20. Nd6 Ree8 21. Nxe8 Rxe8 22. Rxd7 Nc5 23. Rc7 Bf8 $17) 14... Re4!! {[%mdl 64]} 15. Nc2 (15. Bxe4 Nxe4 16. e3 Nc6 17. Nxc6 bxc6 18. Rc1 Rxc8 19. Qxd7 Qb8 $17) (15. e3 $144 Nc6! 16. Bxe4 Nxe4) 15... Qf8 16. Nd6?! (16. Bxe4 $142 Nxe4 17. Qd5! Qxc8 18. Qxe4 Bxa1 19. Nxa1 d5! 20. Qxd5 Qh3+ 21. Qg2 Qd7 22. Qf3 Nc6 23. Kg2 Qd2 $15) 16... Re6 17. Nxb7 (17. Nb5 Nc6 $15 {[%csl Rf1]}) 17... Nc6 {The b7-knight will not come out anymore!} 18. Rc1 Rb8 19. Nd4 (19. Bxc6 dxc6 20. Na5? Rd8 21. Qe1 Nd5 {[%cal Rg7c3]} 22. Na1 $8 Nb4 $19) 19... Rxb7 20. Nxe6 fxe6 $17 21. Bxc6 (21. Qd2!?) 21... dxc6 22. Qd4 Rf7? (22... Nd5 $17) 23. Kg2? (23. Rxc6 Nd5 24. Qc5 Qxc5 25. Rxc5 Bd4 26. Rc8+ Kg7 27. f3 $15) 23... Nd5 24. Qc5 Qxc5 25. Rxc5 Bd4 26. Rxc6 Rxf2+ 27. Kh3 Rxe2 $19 28. Rf1 h5 29. Rfc1 Kg7 30. R1c2 Rxc2 31. Rxc2 e5 32. Rc6 Nb4 33. Rc7+ Kf6 34. a3 Nd5 35. Rc6+ Kf5 36. Kg2 e4 37. Kf1 e3 38. Ke1 Ke4 39. Rd6 g5 40. b4 Nc3 41. Rg6 g4 42. Rh6 Kd3 43. Rxh5 Ne4 44. Rd5 Nd2 0-1

