1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 g6 3. Nc3 d5 4. Nf3 Bg7 5. Qb3 dxc4 6. Qxc4 O-O 7. e4 a6 8. e5 b5 9. Qb3 Nfd7 10. Ng5!? {A very rare move. However, in the hands of Magnus almost every sensible continuation is strong.} Nb6 11. Be3 Nc6 12. Rd1 Bf5 {Other options are still to be explored.} (12... h6 13. Nge4!?) (12... Na5 13. Qb4 Nac4 14. Bc1 Bf5 15. Bxc4 Nxc4 16. O-O? (16. Nge4!?) 16... Bc2 17. e6 Bxd1 18. exf7+ Kh8 19. Rxd1 Qd7 $17 {0-1 Hanley,C (2429)-Poobalasingam,P (2312)/Hinckley Island ENG 2010/The Week in Chess 798 (26)}) 13. Be2 (13. e6?! f6 14. Nf7 Qc8 15. d5 Na5 16. Qb4 Nac4 17. Bxc4 Nxc4 18. Qxe7 Nxe3 19. fxe3 Re8 20. Qc5 Bxe6! 21. dxe6 Qxe6 $17) 13... Na5 14. Qb4 Nac4 15. O-O f6 (15... Nxe3 16. fxe3 Bh6 17. e4!) (15... c6!?) 16. Nf3 (16. Nge4!? Qe8!? $13) 16... Nxe3 17. fxe3 fxe5?! (17... Nd5 18. Nxd5 Qxd5 19. Qxe7 Qxa2 $13) 18. dxe5 Qe8 19. Qc5 Rc8 20. a4 (20. Nd4!? $36) 20... Nxa4 (20... Bc2?! 21. Rde1 Nxa4 22. Nxa4 Bxa4 23. Nd4 {[%csl Ra4]}) 21. Nxa4 bxa4 22. Nd4 (22. Bxa6 Rb8 23. Bc4+ e6 24. Ng5!? h6 25. Rxf5 Rxf5 26. Bxe6+ Kh8 27. Bxf5 hxg5 28. Be4 Qxe5 $11) (22. g4! Be6 23. Nd4 Rxf1+ 24. Rxf1 Bd7 25. Bxa6 Rb8 26. Rf2 $14) 22... Rb8 23. g4 (23. Rd2 Bh6 24. Nxf5 Rxf5 25. Rxf5 gxf5 26. Bxa6 e6 $11) 23... Be4 (23... Bd7?! 24. Rxf8+ Bxf8 $8 25. e6) 24. Ne6 Rxf1+ 25. Bxf1 c6 26. Ng5 (26. Bc4 $142 Bd5! 27. Bxd5 cxd5 28. Rxd5 h6 $11) 26... Bd5 27. e4 Bb3 28. Bc4+ e6! 29. Nxe6 (29. Rf1 Bxc4 30. Qxc4 Bxe5) 29... Bxc4 30. Qxc4 Kh8?? $138 {Black finally succumbs to pressure.} (30... Bxe5! {, and the discovered check proves harmless:} 31. Ng5+ (31. Nc5+ Qf7 32. Qxf7+ Kxf7 33. Nd7 Re8) (31. Rf1 Qe7! 32. Nd8+ Kh8 33. Nxc6 (33. Nf7+ Kg7 34. Nxe5 Qxe5) 33... Bxh2+! 34. Kxh2 Qh4+) 31... Kh8 32. Nf7+ Kg7 {, and it is now Black who will play for a win.}) 31. Nxg7 Kxg7 32. e6 $18 {[%csl Ge6]} Rb7 33. Qc3+ Kg8 34. Rd6 Re7 35. Rxc6 Qf8 36. Rc8 Re8 37. Rxe8 Qxe8 38. Qf6 Qc8 39. Kg2 Qc2+ 40. Kh3 Qc5 41. Kh4 Qb4 42. Qf7+ Kh8 43. e7 Qe1+ 44. Kg5 Qe3+ 45. Qf4 1-0

