1. c4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. Nc3 a6 5. c5 Bf5 6. Nh4 Bg6 7. Bf4 (7. Qb3 Qc8 8. Nxg6 hxg6 9. e3 Nbd7 10. Bd2 e5 11. f4 exf4 12. exf4 Be7 13. O-O-O Nf8 14. Bd3 Ne6 15. Ne2 Ng4 16. Rdf1 f5 $11 {½-½ Sasikiran,K (2694)-Movsesian,S (2732)/Dresden 2008 (24)}) 7... Nbd7 8. Nxg6 (8. e3 {should be answered with} e5! (8... e6 9. h3 Be7 10. Nxg6 hxg6 11. Bd3 Qc8 12. O-O O-O 13. b4 Re8 14. Bh2 Bd8 15. f4 $14 {1-0 Anand,V (2791)-Wang Yue (2739)/Nice (rapid) 2009 (61)}) 9. dxe5 (9. Bg3 Be7 $11 {0-1 Akobian,V (2612)-Lenderman,A (2434)/Ledyard 2009 (34)}) (9. Bxe5 Nxe5 10. dxe5 Nd7 $132) 9... Nh5 {with good play for Black}) 8... hxg6 9. h3 (9. e3 e5!) 9... b6 $146 (9... e5 10. dxe5 Ng4 (10... Qc7 11. b4 Nxe5 12. e3 $14) (10... Nh5!? 11. Bh2 Bxc5 $13 12. g4 $140 Qb6 13. e3 Qxb2 14. Rc1 d4!) 11. e4 Ngxe5 (11... Ndxe5? 12. hxg4 Rxh1 13. Bxe5) 12. exd5 Bxc5 13. dxc6 $14) (9... e6 10. e3 Be7 11. Bd3 Qc8 {now the best for White is} 12. O-O $14 {which transposes to the aforementioned game Anand-Wang Yue, see 8.e3 e6 above.}) 10. cxb6 (10. b4? bxc5 11. bxc5 e5 12. dxe5 Bxc5! 13. exf6 Qxf6 {[%csl Rc3,Rf4]} 14. Qc1 (14. Qd2? Bb4) 14... Bd4 (14... Bb4? 15. Bd2) 15. Bd2 Bxf2+ 16. Kd1 O-O $17) 10... Qxb6 11. Rb1 e6 12. e3 c5 13. a3 Bd6 (13... cxd4 $142 14. exd4 Bd6 15. Be3 O-O 16. Bd3 $14 {/=}) (13... Be7 14. dxc5 Nxc5 15. b4 $14) 14. Na4 Qc7 (14... Qa5+? 15. b4 cxb4 16. Bxd6 b3+ 17. Bb4 Qxa4 18. Rxb3 $16) 15. Bxd6 Qxd6 16. Nxc5 Nxc5 17. dxc5 Qxc5 18. Qa4+ Ke7 19. Bd3 a5 20. Ke2 $14 {The king leaves the first rank so that later Black takes on c1 without check. White has a slight advantage, but with accurate play Black should be able to neutralize it.} (20. O-O Rhc8 $11) 20... Rhc8 (20... d4 $142 ! 21. Qxd4 (21. exd4 Qh5+ 22. g4 Qd5 $44) 21... Qxd4 22. exd4 Rhd8 23. Rhc1 Rxd4 $14 {/=}) 21. Rhc1 Qxc1 (21... Qb6 22. Rxc8 Rxc8 23. b4 $14) 22. Rxc1 Rxc1 23. b4 Kf8?! (23... e5 24. Kd2 $14 (24. Qb5!?)) (23... Ne4 24. Bxe4 dxe4 25. b5 $14) 24. bxa5 Kg8 25. a6 $16 Rc7 26. Qf4 Rca7 27. Qd4 Ne4 (27... Rc7 28. Qb6 Rca7 29. h4 $16) 28. Qb6 e5?! (28... Nf6 $142 29. h4 $16) 29. Ke1 Ng5 30. Bb5 Ne6 31. a4 $18 d4 (31... Kh7 32. a5 Kg8 33. Bc6 Rxa6 34. Bxa8 Rxb6 35. axb6 $18) 32. a5 Rc7 (32... dxe3 33. fxe3 Nf8 (33... g5 34. Ke2 g6 35. Bc6 Rxa6 36. Bxa8 Rxb6 37. axb6 Nc5 38. Bd5 $18) 34. Bc4 (34. Bc6 Rxa6 35. Bxa8 Rxb6 36. axb6 Nd7 37. b7 $11 {[%csl Ra8]}) 34... Kh7 35. Qb5 f6 36. Bd5 $18) 33. Bc6 (33. Bc6 Raa7 34. Bb7 $18) 1-0

