1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. e3 a6 5. Bd3 Bg4 6. Nbd2 Nbd7 7. Qc2 e6 8. O-O dxc4 9. Bxc4 Be7 10. e4 O-O 11. Bd3 $146 (11. Ne5 Bh5 (11... Nxe5!? 12. dxe5 Nd7 13. h3 Bh5 14. f4 b5 15. g4 Bg6 16. Be2 f6 $132) 12. Nxd7 Qxd7 13. Nb3 a5 14. a4 Bg6 15. f3 Nd5 16. Qe2 Nb4 17. Rd1 b6 $11 {1-0 Bacrot,E (2709)-Drozdovskij,Y (2558)/Odessa 2007 (rapid)/ (56)}) 11... h6 12. h3 Bh5 $11 13. e5?! {White starts doubtful complications.} Nd5 14. g4 Nb4 (14... Bg6 15. Bxg6 fxg6 16. Qxg6 Nf4 17. Qe4 Nxh3+ 18. Kh2 Nf4 19. Nc4 Nd5 20. Kg2 $13 {[%cal Gf1h1,Gg4g5]}) 15. Bh7+ Kh8 16. Qb1 f5! 17. exf6 Nxf6 18. gxh5 (18. Bg6 Bxg6 19. Qxg6 Nfd5 $17) 18... Nxh7 19. Ne5 Kg8 (19... Bd6 {was an attractive alternative:} 20. Ng6+ Kg8 21. Nxf8 Qg5+! (21... Qxf8 22. Nc4 Bc7 23. Ne5 $16) 22. Kh1 Rxf8 $44 23. Ne4 $140 ? Qxh5 $19) 20. Qg6 Rf6 21. Qg4 Ng5 22. Ndc4 (22. h4? Rf4! 23. Qg3 (23. Qxf4 Nh3+ $19) 23... Rxh4 $19) 22... Nd5 23. h4 (23. Bxg5 hxg5 24. Qxg5? Rf5 $17) 23... Nf7 24. Kh1 Bf8 25. Be3 Ne7?? {Missing White's reply.} (25... Qe8! $15 {[%csl Rh5][%cal Ga8d8,Gf6f5]}) 26. Nb6! {A nice and unexpected blow.} Ra7 (26... Qxb6 27. Nd7 $16) 27. Ned7 Rf5 28. Rg1 Nd5 29. Nxd5 (29. Nxf8 {wins quicker:} Qxf8 (29... Kxf8 30. Qxg7+ Ke7 31. Bxh6! Nxb6 (31... Qxb6 32. Qf8+ Kd7 33. Rg7 $18) 32. Bg5+ Rxg5 33. hxg5 $18) 30. Nd7 $18) 29... Rxd5 (29... cxd5 30. Nxf8 Qxf8 31. Rac1 Ra8 32. Rc7 $18) 30. Nxf8 Qxf8 31. Rg3 Ra8 32. Rag1 Kh8 33. Qxe6! (33. Qxg7+ Qxg7 34. Rxg7 Rf8 35. Kh2 Rxh5 36. Kh3 $16) 33... Rxh5 34. Qg4 g6 (34... Rd5 35. Qxg7+ Qxg7 36. Rxg7 $18) 35. d5? {Throwing it all away.} (35. Qxg6 Rxh4+ 36. Kg2 {[%cal Gg6f6]} Nd6 37. d5 cxd5 38. Bc5 Rd8 39. Kf1 $18) 35... Ne5 36. Bd4 Qf6! {[%csl Rh4]} 37. Bxe5 Qxe5 38. dxc6 bxc6 39. Rd1 Rg8 40. Qd4 Qxd4 41. Rxd4 g5 42. Rc3 Rf8 43. Kg1 ({After} 43. Rxc6 Rxf2 44. Rxa6 {a safe method to make a draw is the following:} Rxh4+ ({but not} 44... Rxb2?? 45. Rd8+! Kg7 46. Rd7+ Kg8 47. Ra8+ {and mate}) 45. Rxh4 gxh4 46. Rxh6+ (46. b4 Rb2 47. a3 Kg7 $11) 46... Kg7 47. Rb6 Kf7 48. a4 Ke7 49. a5 Kd7 50. a6 Kc7 51. Rb7+ (51. a7 Rf1+ 52. Kg2 Ra1 $11) 51... Kc8 52. b4 Ra2 53. b5 h3 54. Rh7 Kb8 55. Rxh3 {with a theoretical draw. For instance:} Ka7 56. Rh7+ (56. Kg1 Kb6) 56... Ka8 57. Kg1 Rb2 58. Rh5 Ka7 59. Kf1 Kb6 $11) 43... Rf6 44. hxg5 Rxg5+ 45. Kf1 Kg7 $11 46. Rdc4 Ra5 47. a3 Rb5 48. Rc2 Rd6 49. a4 Rb6 50. b4 a5 51. bxa5 Ra6 52. Rg4+ Kf7 53. Rc5 Rd5 54. Rgc4 Rxa5 55. Rxc6 Rd1+ 56. Ke2 Ra1 57. Rf4+ Ke7 58. Rcc4 h5 59. Rb4 Ra2+ 60. Kf3 Ra3+ 61. Kg2 Ke6 62. Rbe4+ Kd6 63. f3 Ra2+ 64. Kh3 Ra1 65. Rd4+ Ke6 66. Rb4 Rg5 67. Rfe4+ Kf6 68. Rf4+ Ke6 69. Rb6+ Ke7 70. Rb2 Rh1+ 71. Rh2 Ra1 72. Kh4 Rg8 73. Rd4 Kf6 74. Rf4+ Ke5 75. Rb4 Kf5 76. Kh3 Ra3 77. Rf2 Ra8 78. Rb5+ Kf4 79. Rxh5 Rxf3+ 1/2-1/2

