8... Qxb2?? (38... Kb6! {[%cal Rc4c3]} 39. Rf5 Qe1+ 40. Kg2 Qe4+ 41. Rf3 c3 (41... Rxh6 $11) 42. Qd6+ Kb7 43. Qe7+ Qxe7 44. fxe7 c2 45. Rc3 b4 46. Rc4 Kb6 47. h7 Kb5 48. Rc7 Kb6 $11 {S.Zagrebelny}) 39. Rf5+ Kb4 40. Qxb5+ Kc3 41. Rf3+ 1-0

